  <h2>Your Brand, Our Manufacturing: Private Label with Low MOQs</h2>
  <p>Launching <strong>private label yoga clothing with low minimums</strong> is now possible thanks to the evolution of agile manufacturing in China. You don't need a million-dollar budget to start a professional line.</p>
  
  <h3>The Path to Launch</h3>
  <p>The fastest way to launch is to select proven, high-performance styles and apply your custom branding. This includes custom heat-transfer logos, woven labels, and branded hangtags.</p>
  
  <h3>Key Elements of a Private Label Program</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Branding:</strong> Custom labels and packaging that elevate the customer unboxing experience.</li>
    <li><strong>Low Risk:</strong> Start with as few as 100 pieces per style to validate your market and design.</li>
    <li><strong>Scalability:</strong> Once a style takes off, a professional factory can scale production to thousands of units seamlessly.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Fitclo's private label program is specifically designed to help emerging brands grow from their first 100 pieces to global scale.</p>
